        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Regency Road, Adelaide; Klemzig; Dudley Park; Kilkenny; Broadview\n- Products: Arndale Shopping Centre\n- Systems: Muller Road; North East Road; Adelaide-Gawler railway line\n- Organizations: City of Port Adelaide Enfield\n\nFacts:\n- Regency Road in Adelaide is located about 6 km north of the city centre.\n- Regency Road spans from Arndale Shopping Centre in Kilkenny in the west to Broadview in the east.\n- Regency Road continues eastwards as Muller Road and ends at North East Road in Klemzig.\n- Klemzig is a suburb of Adelaide in the City of Port Adelaide Enfield.\n- Dudley Park is bordered on the north by Regency Road, on the south by Simpson Avenue, on the east by the Adelaide-Gawler railway line, and on the west by a line running north-south from the Harrison Road–Simpson Avenue intersection to Regency Road.",
